{"shortDescription":"NEW BRITAIN, Conn., Sept. 23, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Stanley Black \u0026 Decker (NYSE:SWK) will release its third quarter 2026 earnings on Wednesday, November 4, 2026, before the market opens, followed by an earnings call at 8:00AM ET. The call will be available through a live teleconference and a listen…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["NEW BRITAIN, Conn., Sept. 23, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- ",{"type":"b","children":["Stanley Black \u0026 Decker"]}," (",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:SWK","text":"NYSE:SWK"}},") will release its third quarter 2026 earnings on Wednesday, November 4, 2026, before the market opens, followed by an earnings call at 8:00AM ET. The call will be available through a live teleconference and a listen-only webcast."]},{"type":"p","children":["Direct links to register for the teleconference, access the webcast, and view the accompanying slide presentation will be available in the \"",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4781275-1\u0026h=3409174357\u0026u=https%3A%2F%2Fir.stanleyblackanddecker.com%2Fnews-events%2Fevents%2Fdefault.aspx%3F_gl%3D1*1vg0ht1*_gcl_au*NDc0MjY0MDU5LjE3ODA4ODc5NDAuNDc0NTEzNTk3LjE3ODE3MTkzODIuMTc4MTcxOTM4Mg..\u0026a=Events","linkText":"Events"}},"\" section of the Stanley Black \u0026 Decker Investors website at ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4781275-1\u0026h=1511266598\u0026u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.stanleyblackanddecker.com%2Finvestors\u0026a=www.stanleyblackanddecker.com%2Finvestors","linkText":"www.stanleyblackanddecker.com/investors"}},". A replay will be available in the same location approximately two hours after the call."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4781275-1\u0026h=783044137\u0026u=https%3A%2F%2Fregister-conf.media-server.com%2Fregister%2FBI61078526ea04469aa72eb6224b